<item>
            <title>[MAHOUT-1642] Iterator class within SimilarItems class always misses the first element</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/MAHOUT-1642</link>
                <project id="12310751" key="MAHOUT">Mahout</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;In the next() function of SimilarItemsIterator class within SimilarItems class, variable &apos;index&apos; is incremented before returning the actual element at that position, therefore the first element when iterating will always be missed.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
